{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Far off in sunlit places
[G]Sad are the Scottish faces
[C]Yearning to [G]feel the kiss
[D]Of sweet Scottish rain
[G]Where tropic skies are beaming
[G]Love sets the heart a-dreaming
[C]Longing and [G]dreaming for the [D]homeland [G]again
{end_of_verse}

